# Vercel Environment Variables Example
# Add these in your Vercel project settings under Environment Variables

# API Configuration - MUST BE ABSOLUTE URL
# CRITICAL: Must start with https:// (or http:// for local development)
# CRITICAL: Must be ONLY the Railway domain, not the Vercel domain
# 
# ✅ CORRECT:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://robohatchapi-production.up.railway.app
#
# ❌ WRONG (missing protocol):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=robohatchapi-production.up.railway.app
#
# ❌ WRONG (relative path):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api
#
# ❌ WRONG (includes vercel domain):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://robohatch-platform-web.vercel.app/robohatchapi-production.up.railway.app
#
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-railway-api.up.railway.app

# Example with actual Railway domain:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://robohatchapi-production.up.railway.app

# Note: NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix makes the variable available in the browser
# Never add sensitive keys with the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix!
